{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Protocol","externalID":"s:11WorldModule8RelationP","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Relation"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Relation","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"protocol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Relations.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Relations.swift#L61"},"title":"Relation","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"inheritsFrom","title":"Inherits From","kind":"relationships"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf"],"type":"conformingTypes","title":"Conforming Types","kind":"relationships"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/relation"]}],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/isExclusive","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/onTargetDespawn"],"title":"Type Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that describes a kind of link from one entity to others."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Relation","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A relation links a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"source","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" entity to one or more ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"target"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" entities: a unit likes another,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a turret is aimed at a ship, a part is a child of its parent (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"). Declare a relation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as a type that conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Relation","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", then link entities with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/relate(_:_:to:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct Likes: Relation {}","","var world = World()","let alice = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Alice\"))","let bob = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Bob\"))","world.relate(alice, Likes(), to: bob)","","print(world.targets(Likes.self, of: alice) == [bob])","\/\/ Prints \"true\"","print(world.sources(Likes.self, of: bob) == [alice])","\/\/ Prints \"true\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The world stores each link as a pair of a target and a value of the relation, so a relation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can carry data about the link:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct Owes: Relation { var amount: Int }","","var world = World()","let alice = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Alice\"))","let bob = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Bob\"))","world.relate(alice, Owes(amount: 20), to: bob)","","if let debt = world[Targets<Owes>.self, of: alice][bob] {","    print(debt.amount)","    \/\/ Prints \"20\"","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Querying-Relations","text":"Querying Relations"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A source holds its pairs of a relation in a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" component, so you can read and filter","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on it like any other component. The world also keeps an index of each target’s sources, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"filtering a query with ","type":"text"},{"code":".related(_:to:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" visits only the entities related to that target:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["var world = World()","let alice = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Alice\"))","let bob = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Bob\"))","let carol = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Carol\"))","world.relate(alice, Likes(), to: bob)","world.relate(carol, Likes(), to: bob)","","let fans = world.query(Name.self).related(Likes.self, to: bob).map { $0.1.value }","print(fans.sorted())","\/\/ Prints \"[\"Alice\", \"Carol\"]\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Customizing-a-Relation","text":"Customizing a Relation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"By default a source can relate to any number of targets, and despawning a target removes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"its pairs from the sources. Implement "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/isExclusive"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/onTargetDespawn"},{"type":"text","text":" to change that."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/CleanupAction"],"title":"Relating Entities","generated":true,"anchor":"Relating-Entities"}],"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Store the state of a game or simulation as entities and components, and read and change it with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"queries, updates, and commands."}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule","title":"WorldModule"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/relate(_:_:to:)":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Links a source entity to a target entity by a relation."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"relate(_:_:to:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/relate(_:_:to:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"relate"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"R"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"R"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"to"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/relate(_:_:to:)"},"doc://WorldModule/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Relation/isExclusive":{"defaultImplementations":1,"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/relation\/isexclusive","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/isExclusive","title":"isExclusive","required":true,"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isExclusive"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A Boolean value indicating whether a source relates to at most one target.","type":"text"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/CleanupAction":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/cleanupaction","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/CleanupAction","title":"CleanupAction","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CleanupAction","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CleanupAction","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"What despawning a relation’s target does to the sources related to it.","type":"text"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Targets":{"kind":"symbol","title":"Targets","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/targets","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Targets","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Targets","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The component that holds a source entity’s targets of a relation, with the relation’s value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for each."}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/ChildOf":{"kind":"symbol","title":"ChildOf","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/childof","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ChildOf"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ChildOf"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The relation that links a child entity to its parent."}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Relation":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that describes a kind of link from one entity to others."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"Relation","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/relation","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Relation","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Relation","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation"},"doc://WorldModule/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/SavingAndLoadingWorlds":{"kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/savingandloadingworlds","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds","title":"Saving and Loading Worlds","role":"article","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Save a world’s entities and components, restore them later, and spawn saved groups of entities"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"into other worlds."}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Relation/onTargetDespawn":{"defaultImplementations":1,"kind":"symbol","title":"onTargetDespawn","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/onTargetDespawn","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/relation\/ontargetdespawn","required":true,"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onTargetDespawn","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CleanupAction","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule13CleanupActionO","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"What despawning a target does to the sources related to it.","type":"text"}]}}}